 result←object Pop arg;cbits;at;new
 :If ⍬≢new←object ⎕VGET⊂'_push_image'⍬
     cbits←object._pic ##.##.∆WG'CBits' ⍝ The Bitmap child will always exist
     arg←##.##.Single arg
     '∆WI RANK ERROR: Pop'##.##.Error 1≠≢⍴arg
     '∆WI LENGTH ERROR: Pop'##.##.Error 2≠≢arg
     at←2↑1↓arg,0 0
     '∆WI DOMAIN ERROR: Pop'##.##.Error~##.##.IsNum at
     '∆WI DOMAIN ERROR: Pop'##.##.Error∨/at<0
     at←(⍴new),⍨⌊0.5+at×⊃##._supp.MyUnits object ⍝ Convert scaled arg to whole pixels
     '∆WI DOMAIN ERROR: Pop'##.##.Error∨/cbits⍴⍛<+⌿2 2⍴at
     (at[3 4]↑at[1 2]↓cbits)←new ⍝ Replace just those pixels (previously stored in ⊥RGB form)
     object._pic ##.##.∆WS⊂'CBits'cbits
 :EndIf
 result←##.NoRes
